	There is a setting in the kernel which limits the number of
connections. You can add it in through dxkerneltuner, or a using a
sysconfigdb file.  I think it is in the "pts" kernel section.  Just been
caught out on this one !!!  Also when doing the MAKEDEV, make sure all
the /dev files are sequential.  You can't have gaps.
