    Thanks for the help.  I found the underlying problem.

    VMS doesn't care about 7- or 8-bit terminals.  It's terminal driver
(ttdriver) 'autosizes' the incoming data bits.  Unix, on the other hand,
doesn't.   ProComm Plus was set to 8-bin and Unix was expecting 7-bin.  Reset
the client and everything's ok.

jim c.




