The `ldd(1)' utility has been added to Tru64 Unix in versions 4.0g and
5.0, and presumably for all versions higher than 4.0g.

This utility gives better information on exactly which libraries would
be linked in for a given executable or shared subroutine library than
the `odump(1)' utility, and can also print warnings for unresolved
symbol references.

