I have seen first hand bugs in two of the AdvFS utilities.  One is rmvol
the other is balance.  Basically, these routines move files from volumes
within the domain.

Man pages make no mention of having reduced activity on the filesystems
mounted on the domains.  But I completely lost two large +200 Gig
filesystems using these utilities while activity was fairly high.

The advfs just simply goes away and there is no way back other than to
salvage the data into files named for their i-nodes.

Other than these two catastrophes, on different machines one running 4.0d
and one 4.0f we have had no problems with advfs.  But they make me nervous.

Hope this helps.

Richard

