Following up on my previous message, you get the daemons started on boot by
creating links in /sbin/rc*.d:

lrwxr-xr-x 1 root bin 13 Jul 22 1997 /sbin/rc0.d/K30nfs -> ../init.d/nfs
lrwxr-xr-x 1 root bin 18 Jul 22 1997 /sbin/rc0.d/K35nfsmount -> ../init.d/nfsmount
lrwxr-xr-x 1 root bin 13 Jul 22 1997 /sbin/rc2.d/K35nfs -> ../init.d/nfs
